====== PC Engines APU ======
APU system boards are designed and manufacturered by [[http://pcengines.ch/apu.htm|PC Engines]]. Boards are based on AMD [[wp>Bobcat (microarchitecture)|Bobcat]] low consumption APUs. The boards and other components (enclosures, power supplies, wireless cards, CompactFlash cards, etc) are sold separately, although some retailers sell pre-build kits.

APU boards and associated accessories are readily available from [[http://www.pcengines.ch/order.php|resellers]] across Europe and North America. 

See also [[toh:pcengines:apu2|PC Engines APU 2]] for the next generation of APU boards.

